          <li><span class="tl-item" data-i18n="press.2024-07-iidrr.title">iidrr Interview with Mingyue Luna Chen</span><span class="tl-meta"><em>Jul 2024</em> · :IIDRR.Space</span></li>
          <li><span class="tl-item" data-i18n="press.2024-07-shanghai.title">Can small and exquisite indie games light the way forward?</span><span class="tl-meta"><em>Jul 2024</em> · Shanghai Science and Technology Innovation, Wen Wei Po</span></li>
          <li><span class="tl-item" data-i18n="press.2024-06.title">Art Show — The Nature of Home: Taking Root in a Place, Group Show</span><span class="tl-meta"><em>Jun 2024</em> · Li Tang, ArtRabbit, ArtForum</span></li>
          <li><span class="tl-item" data-i18n="press.2024-04.title">Lunaaa.Studio: From Brooklyn to Guangzhou — An Adventure of Game and Art</span><span class="tl-meta"><em>Apr 2024</em> · China Daily, Gamersky, Vogue Chinese Front Page, Artron.net</span></li>
          <li><span class="tl-item" data-i18n="press.2023-08.title">The First Solo Exhibition in New York by Millenial Artist Mingyue Chen: The Land of Nothingness</span><span class="tl-meta"><em>Aug 2023</em> · Marie Claire China, Artron.net, Meer, ArtRabbit, NYU Tisch ITP/IMA</span></li>
          <li><span class="tl-item" data-i18n="press.2022-09.title">This Is Not A Drill* Exhibition — Team Rising, Tisch Creative Research Fellowship</span><span class="tl-meta"><em>Sept 2022</em> · NYU Tisch, Academicgates</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

